<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14214] Incorrect merge query when using oracle dialect</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14214</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If table contains only keys (e.g. relationship table) then returned query contains empty update fields and resulting syntax is incorrect.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Consider the following example:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;org.apache.ignite.cache.store.jdbc.dialect.OracleDialect#mergeQuery accepts key and val collections. The problem is relevant if val collection is empty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;.format(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;MERGE INTO %s t&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot; USING (SELECT %s FROM dual) v&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;  ON %s&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot; WHEN MATCHED THEN&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;  UPDATE SET %s&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot; WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;  INSERT (%s) VALUES (%s)&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, fullTblName, selCols, match, setCols, colsLst, valuesCols);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
